      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement \n   1. 3 Types of Notification(sms/email/in-app/otp)\n   2. I want template based Notification to give to third\n    party\n   3. Give Dashboard to User to show status of all the \n    notification status \n   4. Respect User Prefernce -> channel opt-ins , Cateogry-opt-ins ,\n   5. At least once delivery \n",
      "rawText": "Functional Requirement \n   1. 3 Types of Notification(sms/email/in-app/otp)\n   2. I want template based Notification to give to third\n    party\n   3. Give Dashboard to User to show status of all the \n    notification status \n   4. Respect User Prefernce -> channel opt-ins , Cateogry-opt-ins ,\n   5. At least once delivery \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement \n   1. 3 Types of Notification(sms/email/in-app/otp)\n   2. I want template based Notification to give to third\n    party\n   3. Give Dashboard to User to show status of all the \n    notification status \n   4. Respect User Prefernce -> channel opt-ins , Cateogry-opt-ins ,\n   5. At least once delivery \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
